.claude/

# deploy
.vercel

# NOTE: _source-assets/ is deliberately NOT ignored. `npm run media` regenerates
# every shipped image from it, so a clone without it cannot rebuild the site's
# photography. It is ~2 MB and never served — nothing outside public/ is.
#
# The design-direction mockups are the exception: they are reference material,
# not brand assets, the build does not need them, and they were the bulk of the
# repository's weight. Kept on disk, out of version control.
_source-assets/ref-*
